# Quarantine for Nsight Compute report artifacts produced on local devices
# (RTX 3090 Ti sm_86 and RTX 5060 laptop sm_120). The CLAUDE.md Rule 1
# exception permits these report files to be written here, but they are
# not committed to the repository — only the per-launch JSON sidecars
# produced by tools/local_labels/import_label.py are tracked.

# Block every Nsight Compute report artifact and its rename variants.
# The trailing `*` matches `.ncu-rep`, `.ncu-repz`, `.ncu-rep.copy`,
# `.ncu-rep-backup`, `.ncu-rep_old`, `.ncu-repz.bak`, `.ncu-repdata`, etc.
*.ncu-rep*

# Sample tooling state that the driver may produce alongside the report.
*.tmp
*.log

# Non-committed scratch outputs. Default output paths of consumer-side
# drivers (e.g. tools/local_labels/run_v5_active_path_comparison.py)
# resolve here so a default invocation can never rewrite a committed
# artifact. Nothing under uncommitted/ is ever tracked.
uncommitted/
